\n                                        Chest tightness when climbing stairs\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"item meta row\">\n                                        <span class=\"font-ui font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"high urgency label chip\" style=\"color:var(--high)\">\n                                            High urgency\n                                        </span>\n                                        · 2 days ago\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"lucide icon-chevron-right mt-1 shrink-0 text-[17px] text-[var(--ink-3)] group-hover:text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"right chevron icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                            <a class=\"group flex items-start gap-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"medium urgency item link\" href=\"#\">\n                                <span class=\"mt-1.5 h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[var(--med)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"medium urgency dot\">\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"item details container\">\n                                    <span class=\"block text-[14px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"item title text\">\n                                        Follow-up on throat symptoms\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"item meta row\">\n                                        <span class=\"font-ui font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"medium urgency label chip\" style=\"color:var(--med)\">\n                                            Medium urgency\n                                        </span>\n                                        · 5 days ago\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"lucide icon-chevron-right mt-1 shrink-0 text-[17px] text-[var(--ink-3)] group-hover:text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"right chevron icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <!-- Due soon -->\n                    <section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"due soon reminders section\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"reminders header row\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-ui text-[15.5px] font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"reminders title heading\">\n                                Due soon\n                            </h3>\n                            <a class=\"font-ui text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--brand)] hover:text-[var(--brand-strong)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"all reminders link\" href=\"#\">\n                                All reminders\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <ul class=\"mt-1 divide-y divide-[var(--rule)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"reminders list\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"metformin refill reminder item\">\n                                <i class=\"lucide icon-calendar shrink-0 text-[18px] text-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"calendar icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"reminder details container\">\n                                    <span class=\"block text-[14px] font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"reminder title text\">\n                                        Refill metformin\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"reminder due date text\">\n                                        Due in 2 days\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--rule)] text-[var(--ink-3)] transition-colors hover:border-[var(--brand)] hover:text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"done checkmark button\">\n                                    <i class=\"lucide icon-check text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"blood pressure reminder item\">\n                                <i class=\"lucide icon-calendar shrink-0 text-[18px] text-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"calendar icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"reminder details container\">\n                                    <span class=\"block text-[14px] font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"reminder title text\">\n                                        Blood pressure recheck\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"reminder due date text\">\n                                        Due in 5 days\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--rule)] text-[var(--ink-3)] transition-colors hover:border-[var(--brand)] hover:text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"done checkmark button\">\n                                    <i class=\"lucide icon-check text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </section>\n                    <!-- Today's health tip (consolidated) -->\n                    <section class=\"rounded-2xl bg-[var(--brand-tint)] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3\" data-name=\"today's health tip card\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"health tip header row\">\n                            <i class=\"lucide icon-heart-pulse text-[18px] text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"heart pulse icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <h3 class=\"font-ui text-[15.5px] font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"health tip title heading\">\n                                Today's health tip\n                            </h3>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"health tip tip text\">\n                            <span class=\"font-ui font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"health tip bold intro\">\n                                Small changes count.\n                            </span>\n                            A short walk, a glass of water, or a consistent bedtime can support your wellbeing.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] leading-snug text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-3\" data-name=\"health tip additional info text\">\n                            Also worth a look:\n                            <span class=\"font-medium text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"health tip first link text\">\n                                track what changes\n                            </span>\n                            over time, and\n                            <span class=\"font-medium text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"health tip second link text\">\n                                know your red flags\n                            </span>\n                            — sudden or severe symptoms need professional evaluation.\n                        </p>\n                    </section>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-center text-[12.5px] text-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"footer disclaimer text\">\n                <i class=\"lucide icon-shield-check text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"shield check icon\">\n                </i>\n                MediAssist provides educational information only — not a medical diagnosis, treatment plan, or emergency service.\n            </p>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-10-18T11:42:48.270517+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-10-18T11:44:00.883356+00:00",
      "id": "var_62fedc26ba12",
      "contentHeight": 1779
    },
    "var_e7bb1226581a": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Health check-in — revamp",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 9240,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Atkinson+Hyperlegible:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@1.48.0/font/lucide.css');\n.ma-root{\n  --canvas:#F3F7FA; --surface:#FFFFFF; --surface-alt:#EAF3F8; --ink:#172B3A; --ink-2:#4B606D;\n  --rule:#CEDCE4; --brand:#126B9A; --brand-strong:#0E567B; --brand-tint:#E7F1F7;\n  --low:#237B69; --low-bg:#E7F4EF; --med:#956018; --med-bg:#FBF1DC; --high:#AB502B; --high-bg:#FBE9DE; --emg:#AE3446; --emg-bg:#FBE6E9;\n  font-family:'Manrope',system-ui,sans-serif; color:var(--ink); background:var(--canvas);\n}\n.ma-read{font-family:'Atkinson Hyperlegible',system-ui,sans-serif;}\n.ma-num{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}\n.ma-field:focus-within{border-color:var(--brand);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(18,107,154,.15);}\n.ma-nav-active{background:var(--brand-tint);color:var(--brand);}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ma-root min-h-screen w-full\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"app root layout\">\n    <!-- SIDEBAR -->\n    <aside class=\"fixed inset-y-0 left-0 z-40 hidden w-[264px] flex-col border-r px-5 py-5 lg:flex\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"sidebar navigation panel\" style=\"background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--rule)\">\n        <a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo link\" href=\"#\">\n            <span class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"logo icon container\" style=\"background:var(--brand-tint)\">\n                <i class=\"icon-heart-pulse text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"heart pulse logo icon\" style=\"color:var(--brand)\">\n                </i>\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-[16px] font-bold tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand name text\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"brand name word Medi\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                    Medi\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"brand name word Assist\" style=\"color:var(--brand)\">\n                    Assist\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"brand name word AI\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                    AI\n                </span>\n            </span>\n        </a>\n        <p class=\"mt-7 mb-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"section label Care\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n            Care\n        </p>\n        <nav class=\"mt-1 flex flex-col gap-1 text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"sidebar navigation menu\">\n            <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 transition\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"nav link Overview\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                <i class=\"icon-house text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"house icon\">\n                </i>\n                Overview\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 transition\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"nav link AI consultation\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                <i class=\"icon-message-square text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"message square icon\">\n                </i>\n                AI consultation\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 transition\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"nav link Voice consultation\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                <i class=\"icon-mic text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"microphone icon\">\n                </i>\n                Voice consultation\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 transition\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4\" data-name=\"nav link Image analysis\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                <i class=\"icon-image text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"image icon\">\n                </i>\n                Image analysis\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 transition\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5\" data-name=\"nav link Nearby care\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                <i class=\"icon-map-pin text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\">\n                </i>\n                Nearby care\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"ma-nav-active flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-6\" data-name=\"nav link Health check-in active\" href=\"#\">\n                <i class=\"icon-shield-check text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-6-1\" data-name=\"shield check icon\">\n                </i>\n                Health check-in\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 transition\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-7\" data-name=\"nav link Reminders\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                <i class=\"icon-bell text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-7-1\" data-name=\"bell icon\">\n                </i>\n                Reminders\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 transition\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8\" data-name=\"nav link Reports\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                <i class=\"icon-file-text text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8-1\" data-name=\"file text icon\">\n                </i>\n                Reports\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"my-3 h-px w-full\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-9\" data-name=\"nav divider line\" style=\"background:var(--rule)\">\n            </div>\n            <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 transition\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-10\" data-name=\"nav link Profile\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                <i class=\"icon-user text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-10-1\" data-name=\"user icon\">\n                </i>\n                Profile\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 transition\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-11\" data-name=\"nav link Settings\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                <i class=\"icon-settings text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-11-1\" data-name=\"settings gear icon\">\n                </i>\n                Settings\n            </a>\n        </nav>\n        <div class=\"mt-auto\" data-kid=\"1-1-4\" data-name=\"sidebar bottom section\">\n            <div class=\"rounded-xl p-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"neighborhood care callout card\" style=\"background:var(--surface-alt)\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"callout header with icon\">\n                    <i class=\"icon-map-pin text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\" style=\"color:var(--brand)\">\n                    </i>\n                    <p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"callout heading text\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                        Need care soon?\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"ma-read mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"callout description text\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                    Find nearby hospitals and emergency rooms.\n                </p>\n                <a class=\"mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12.5px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-3\" data-name=\"find care action link\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--brand)\">\n                    Find care\n                    <i class=\"icon-arrow-right text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <a class=\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium transition hover:opacity-80\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"sign out link\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                <i class=\"icon-log-out text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"log out icon\">\n                </i>\n                Sign out\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n    <!-- MAIN -->\n    <div class=\"lg:pl-[264px]\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main content area\">\n        <!-- TOP HEADER -->\n        <header class=\"sticky top-0 z-30 flex h-16 items-center justify-between border-b px-6 lg:px-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"top header bar\" style=\"background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--rule)\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-[17px] font-bold tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"page title Health check-in\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                Health check-in\n            </h1>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"header actions container\">\n                <button aria-label=\"Toggle dark mode\" class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border transition\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"dark mode toggle button\" style=\"background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--rule);color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                    <i class=\"icon-moon text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"moon icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg py-1 pl-1 pr-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"user account link\" href=\"#\">\n                    <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[12px] font-bold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"avatar initials badge\" style=\"background:var(--brand)\">\n                        DU\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[14px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"displayed user name\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                        Demo User\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n        <!-- CONTENT -->\n        <main class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] px-6 py-8 lg:px-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"main content container\">\n            <div class=\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[440px_minmax(0,1fr)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"two column layout grid\">\n                <!-- LEFT: FORM -->\n                <section class=\"h-fit rounded-2xl border p-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"health risk form panel\" style=\"background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"form panel title\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                        Health risk check-in\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"ma-read mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"form panel description\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                        Lifestyle questions only — educational risk framing, not a clinical diagnosis.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"form field grid\">\n                        <!-- select renderer -->\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"smoking select field\">\n                            <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"smoking field label\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                Smoking\n                            </label>\n                            <div class=\"ma-field flex h-11 items-center justify-between rounded-lg border px-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"smoking select control\" style=\"background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"smoking selected value\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                    Occasional\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"icon-chevron-down text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"select chevron icon\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"alcohol select field\">\n                            <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"alcohol field label\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                Alcohol\n                            </label>\n                            <div class=\"ma-field flex h-11 items-center justify-between rounded-lg border px-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"alcohol select control\" style=\"background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"alcohol selected value\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                    Weekly\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"icon-chevron-down text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"select chevron icon\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"exercise select field\">\n                            <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"exercise field label\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                Exercise\n                            </label>\n                            <div class=\"ma-field flex h-11 items-center justify-between rounded-lg border px-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"exercise select control\" style=\"background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"exercise selected value\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                    Rarely\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"icon-chevron-down text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"select chevron icon\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-4\" data-name=\"diet select field\">\n                            <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"diet field label\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                Diet\n                            </label>\n                            <div class=\"ma-field flex h-11 items-center justify-between rounded-lg border px-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"diet select control\" style=\"background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"diet selected value\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                    Mixed\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"icon-chevron-down text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"select chevron icon\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-5\" data-name=\"sleep select field\">\n                            <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-5-1\" data-name=\"sleep field label\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                Sleep\n                            </label>\n                            <div class=\"ma-field flex h-11 items-center justify-between rounded-lg border px-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-5-2\" data-name=\"sleep select control\" style=\"background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-5-2-1\" data-name=\"sleep selected value\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                    Under 6 hours\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"icon-chevron-down text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-5-2-2\" data-name=\"select chevron icon\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-6\" data-name=\"stress select field\">\n                            <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-6-1\" data-name=\"stress field label\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                Stress\n                            </label>\n                            <div class=\"ma-field flex h-11 items-center justify-between rounded-lg border px-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-6-2\" data-name=\"stress select control\" style=\"background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-6-2-1\" data-name=\"stress selected value\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                    Moderate\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"icon-chevron-down text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-6-2-2\" data-name=\"select chevron icon\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"mt-5 inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-white transition\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-4\" data-name=\"generate risk score button\" style=\"background:var(--brand)\">\n                        <i class=\"icon-calculator text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"calculator icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        Generate risk score\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"mt-6 border-t pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5\" data-name=\"recent check-ins section\" style=\"border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-1\" data-name=\"section heading recent check-ins\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                            Recent check-ins\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2\" data-name=\"check-ins list\">\n                            <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 transition hover:bg-[var(--surface-alt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"check-in entry link\" href=\"#\">\n                                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[13.5px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"check-in score and band\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                    <span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"status dot moderate\" style=\"background:var(--med)\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    44 · Moderate\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"ma-num text-[12.5px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-1-2\" data-name=\"check-in date\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                    Oct 17\n                                </span>\n                            </a>\n                            <div class=\"h-px w-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"check-in divider\" style=\"background:var(--rule)\">\n                            </div>\n                            <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 transition hover:bg-[var(--surface-alt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-3\" data-name=\"check-in entry link\" href=\"#\">\n                                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[13.5px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-3-1\" data-name=\"check-in score and band\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                    <span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"status dot moderate\" style=\"background:var(--med)\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    49 · Moderate\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"ma-num text-[12.5px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-3-2\" data-name=\"check-in date\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                    Oct 10\n                                </span>\n                            </a>\n                            <div class=\"h-px w-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-4\" data-name=\"check-in divider\" style=\"background:var(--rule)\">\n                            </div>\n                            <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 transition hover:bg-[var(--surface-alt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-5\" data-name=\"check-in entry link\" href=\"#\">\n                                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[13.5px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-5-1\" data-name=\"check-in score and band\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                    <span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"status dot moderate\" style=\"background:var(--med)\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    55 · Moderate\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"ma-num text-[12.5px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-5-2-5-2\" data-name=\"check-in date\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                    Oct 3\n                                </span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <!-- RIGHT: RESULTS -->\n                <section class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"results panel\" style=\"background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"results header row\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"results header text\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"results title\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                Your results\n                            </h2>\n                            <p class=\"ma-read mt-1 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"results subtitle\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                Suggestions, trends, and next actions\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <i class=\"icon-shield-check text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"shield check icon\" style=\"color:var(--low)\">\n                        </i>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- focal figure with earned scale -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-5 rounded-xl p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"risk score figure\" style=\"background:var(--surface-alt)\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"risk score header row\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-end gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"risk score and label\">\n                                <span class=\"ma-num text-[46px] font-extrabold leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"risk score number\" style=\"color:var(--med)\">\n                                    44\n                                </span>\n                                <div class=\"pb-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"risk label block\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[15px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"risk band label\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                        Moderate lifestyle risk\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"ma-read text-[12.5px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"calculation date\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                        Calculated Oct 17, 2026\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"band pill badge\" style=\"background:var(--med-bg);color:var(--med)\">\n                                Band: Moderate\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- 0-100 scale -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"risk scale meter\">\n                            <div class=\"relative flex h-2.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"scale bar container\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"low risk band segment\" style=\"width:30%;background:var(--low)\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"moderate risk band segment\" style=\"width:25%;background:var(--med)\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"high risk band segment\" style=\"width:20%;background:var(--high)\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"emergency band segment\" style=\"width:25%;background:var(--emg)\">\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"relative h-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"scale marker row\">\n                                <span class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"scale marker needle\" style=\"left:44%\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-arrow-up text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"up arrow marker icon\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"ma-num relative h-4 text-[11.5px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"scale tick labels\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                <span class=\"absolute\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"tick label 0\" style=\"left:0%\">\n                                    0\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"tick label 30\" style=\"left:30%\">\n                                    30\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"tick label 55\" style=\"left:55%\">\n                                    55\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"tick label 75\" style=\"left:75%\">\n                                    75\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"absolute -translate-x-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-3-5\" data-name=\"tick label 100\" style=\"left:100%\">\n                                    100\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"ma-read mt-1 text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"scale note text\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                Lower is better · educational estimate, not a diagnosis\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- contributing -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"contributing factors section\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"section heading contributing\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                            What's contributing\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"factor tags container\">\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"sleep factor tag\" style=\"border-color:var(--rule);color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                Sleep under 6h\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"exercise factor tag\" style=\"border-color:var(--rule);color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                Rarely exercising\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"smoking factor tag\" style=\"border-color:var(--rule);color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                                Occasional smoking\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- suggestions as separated rows -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"suggestions section\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"section heading suggestions\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                            Suggestions\n                        </p>\n                        <ul class=\"ma-read mt-2 flex flex-col text-[14px] leading-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"suggestions list\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                            <li class=\"flex gap-2.5 py-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"suggestion item sleep\">\n                                <span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"suggestion bullet dot\" style=\"background:var(--brand)\">\n                                </span>\n                                Aim for a consistent 7–9 hour sleep window.\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex gap-2.5 border-t py-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"suggestion item exercise\" style=\"border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                                <span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"suggestion bullet dot\" style=\"background:var(--brand)\">\n                                </span>\n                                Add short walks on most days — even 10 minutes counts.\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex gap-2.5 border-t py-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4-2-3\" data-name=\"suggestion item smoking\" style=\"border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                                <span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"suggestion bullet dot\" style=\"background:var(--brand)\">\n                                </span>\n                                Cut back on smoking — the highest-impact change for your score.\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- talk it through -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5\" data-name=\"talk it through section\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"section heading talk it through\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                            Talk it through\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"conversation starter links\">\n                            <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium transition hover:bg-[var(--surface-alt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"starter link sleep\" href=\"#\" style=\"border-color:var(--rule);color:var(--ink)\">\n                                Help me act on better sleep\n                                <i class=\"icon-arrow-right text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\" style=\"color:var(--brand)\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                            <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium transition hover:bg-[var(--surface-alt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"starter link exercise\" href=\"#\" style=\"border-color:var(--rule);color:var(--ink)\">\n                                Help me build a weekly exercise routine\n                                <i class=\"icon-arrow-right text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\" style=\"color:var(--brand)\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                            <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium transition hover:bg-[var(--surface-alt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-2-3\" data-name=\"starter link smoking\" href=\"#\" style=\"border-color:var(--rule);color:var(--ink)\">\n                                Help me cut back on smoking\n                                <i class=\"icon-arrow-right text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-2-3-1\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\" style=\"color:var(--brand)\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- preventive tips -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-6\" data-name=\"preventive tips section\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"section heading preventive tips\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">\n                            Preventive tips\n                        </p>\n                        <ul class=\"ma-read mt-2 list-disc pl-5 text-[13.5px] leading-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-6-2\" data-name=\"preventive tips list\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-6-2-1\" data-name=\"tip item routine check-up\">\n                                Book a routine check-up to review blood pressure and cholesterol.\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-6-2-2\" data-name=\"tip item vaccinations\">\n                                Keep vaccinations up to date for your age and history.\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"ma-read mt-6 border-t pt-4 text-[13px] leading-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-7\" data-name=\"medical disclaimer text\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2);border-color:var(--rule)\">\n                        This is educational information only and is not a medical diagnosis, treatment plan, or emergency service. Seek professional medical care for symptoms that concern you, and call local emergency services for urgent symptoms.\n                    </p>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
